{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DeadWire</strong> is a top-down tactical shooter where everything can become a chain-reaction trap. Combine firepower with hacking abilities to manipulate the environment and outsmart heavily armed enemies standing in your way. You play as <i>Wire</i>, a skilled hacker trying to save his mentor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chain Reaction Carnage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the high-tech world of <strong>DeadWire</strong>, you can hack enemies and link them to each other and nearby objects, causing deadly chain reactions that turn the environment into a weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix fast shooting, power-ups, and a unique hacking (ReWire) ability</strong> to help you defeat enemies and complete your mission. Use the hack view to spot opportunities, plan your approach, or dive in guns blazing. And if things go wrong, restart and try a new strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ levels and 80+ side objectives -</strong> Handcrafted missions built for challenge and replayability. Unlock cheats and new playstyles as you complete side objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack the World -</strong> Almost everything can be linked. Chain enemies together, overload cars, toggle lasers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons on Weapons -</strong>\u00a0Pistols, smart rifles, cyber grenades and more. Mix hacking with firepower for maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-Objectives, Time Trials</strong> <strong>and Score Mode</strong> - Creative solutions are rewarded! Beat time trials, finish side objectives, and chase high scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Electronic Soundtrack -</strong> Dirty basslines and heavy drums bring the cyberpunk city to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So to sum it all up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadwire is designed to challenge (but it's not impossible)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons and your hacking ability to turn the odds in your favor</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is a mix of fast shooting and slower combat puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a story but it's not story driven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability through side objectives, time trials and score mode</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tokyo Drift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/4ad9829d88a9ceca3142f8808c65dff1f501730a.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Drive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/066498320280d916a6a277494b024604d173074e.jpg"},{"name":"Bullet time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/c31007faa6441816dd37b080abc2786ad1f4206d.jpg"},{"name":"Light Show","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/6722695564ebcfe087b58aa1b0d18e991f73f6da.jpg"},{"name":"Lights out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/fb7744c35fb05fd33ace693b3c7ffab3ab3d46bf.jpg"},{"name":"Up Armor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/7f5a875405e3696cc254aaa2a014feed1f8285c2.jpg"},{"name":"Brrrt!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/7dc385e95aa23f2647f5ff06b965c5b455f7086c.jpg"},{"name":"Wired to death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/c39ef65fe5764c212b3446b96070e18ad36aa4b8.jpg"},{"name":"Chain reaction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/b54632cf96dcb9795597b269f794cdec94924255.jpg"},{"name":"Stabby Stabby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2995100/e8a557424ca3ac1b91a5b229045782659debc1a6.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995100?t=1760608303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760608303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/ae9906c89c5f147aa7629521d0b8cb28f3f637be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760608303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/ae9906c89c5f147aa7629521d0b8cb28f3f637be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760608303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes fictional drugs, violence and blood. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DeadWire</strong> is a top-down tactical shooter where everything can become a chain-reaction trap. Combine firepower with hacking abilities to manipulate the environment and outsmart heavily armed enemies standing in your way. You play as <i>Wire</i>, a skilled hacker trying to save his mentor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chain Reaction Carnage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the high-tech world of <strong>DeadWire</strong>, you can hack enemies and link them to each other and nearby objects, causing deadly chain reactions that turn the environment into a weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix fast shooting, power-ups, and a unique hacking (ReWire) ability</strong> to help you defeat enemies and complete your mission. Use the hack view to spot opportunities, plan your approach, or dive in guns blazing. And if things go wrong, restart and try a new strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ levels and 80+ side objectives -</strong> Handcrafted missions built for challenge and replayability. Unlock cheats and new playstyles as you complete side objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack the World -</strong> Almost everything can be linked. Chain enemies together, overload cars, toggle lasers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons on Weapons -</strong>\u00a0Pistols, smart rifles, cyber grenades and more. Mix hacking with firepower for maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-Objectives, Time Trials</strong> <strong>and Score Mode</strong> - Creative solutions are rewarded! Beat time trials, finish side objectives, and chase high scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Electronic Soundtrack -</strong> Dirty basslines and heavy drums bring the cyberpunk city to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.poster.avif?t=1760608303\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.webm?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.mp4?t=1760608303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So to sum it all up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadwire is designed to challenge (but it's not impossible)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons and your hacking ability to turn the odds in your favor</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is a mix of fast shooting and slower combat puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a story but it's not story driven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability through side objectives, time trials and score mode</p></li></ul>","developers":["Shotgun Anaconda"],"dlc":[3997130],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/header.jpg?t=1760608303","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz (Steamdeck)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz </li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2995100/374911932/253817afeab2cc9062400f37810cd4315fbb650a/1760607702/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760608299","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2995100/374911932/253817afeab2cc9062400f37810cd4315fbb650a/1760607702/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760608299","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2995100/374911932/253817afeab2cc9062400f37810cd4315fbb650a/1760607702/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760608299","id":257218717,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218717/movie480.mp4?t=1760608299","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218717/movie_