,"publishers":["The CoLab"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nAtos criminosos","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogen\nDerbe Sprache\nFantasy-Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"18 Sep, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThere are plenty of cyberpunk games which allow you to use hacking in combat, but few with such immediate, explosive consequences\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cIt feels absolutely badass to use your hacking powers in varied violent ways, and I\u2019m looking forward to causing a lot of damage with them. When I think of hacking in games I think of puzzle mini games, but Deadwire\u2019s hacking focus is so much more than this\u201d<br>Loot Level Chill<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/eec04a76b98b205f2a2435eaf44d0ea98abbc414/ss_eec04a76b98b205f2a2435eaf44d0ea98abbc414.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760608303","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/eec04a76b98b205f2a2435eaf44d0ea98abbc414/ss_eec04a76b98b205f2a2435eaf44d0ea98abbc414.600x338.jpg?t=1760608303"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/6f914e472a080ccfc85640e8e131d4213eeb779d/ss_6f914e472a080ccfc85640e8e131d4213eeb779d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760608303","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/6f914e472a080ccfc85640e8e131d4213eeb779d/ss_6f914e472a080ccfc85640e8e131d4213eeb779d.600x338.jpg?t=1760608303"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/ce900e23352f0960aeeb24effd79e11728e924c1/ss_ce900e23352f0960aeeb24effd79e11728e924c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760608303","path